{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"links\": [\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S01\",\n      \"chunk\": \"S01-1-0\",\n      \"also\": 0,\n      \"why\": \"对能否坦白的迟疑，也落在另一组所说的下次能不能更坦白上。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S02\",\n      \"chunk\": \"S02-0-1\",\n      \"also\": 1,\n      \"why\": \"沉默中的自在，正是另一组害怕太急而破坏的那份舒服。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S02\",\n      \"chunk\": \"S02-1-1\",\n      \"also\": 0,\n      \"why\": \"轻轻松下来的释然，与另一组因对方没有退开而渐渐放松相通。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S04\",\n      \"chunk\": \"S04-0-1\",\n      \"also\": 1,\n      \"why\": \"忍不住继续说的劲头，也对应另一组几乎想把藏着的话全说出来。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S04\",\n      \"chunk\": \"S04-1-0\",\n      \"also\": 0,\n      \"why\": \"话到喉咙却哽住，和另一组想告诉对方却没有开口是同一种迟疑。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S04\",\n      \"chunk\": \"S04-1-1\",\n      \"also\": 2,\n      \"why\": \"不愿松手的依恋，也对应另一组想让眼下的好留久一些、害怕失去自在。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S07\",\n      \"chunk\": \"S07-2-0\",\n      \"also\": 1,\n      \"why\": \"意识到这一刻留不住，正对应另一组舍不得从这份欢喜里抽身。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S08\",\n      \"chunk\": \"S08-1-0\",\n      \"also\": 0,\n      \"why\": \"快乐余温与怀念指向眼前这份好，而另一组正开始盼着它能持续很久。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S09\",\n      \"chunk\": \"S09-1-1\",\n      \"also\": 0,\n      \"why\": \"不安暂时退开，正是另一组想起眼下仍被亲近后得到的短暂缓和。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S11\",\n      \"chunk\": \"S11-0-0\",\n      \"also\": 1,\n      \"why\": \"不再为喜欢道歉的态度，也回应另一组明知对方的选择未定仍愿意陪伴的心意。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S11\",\n      \"chunk\": \"S11-0-1\",\n      \"also\": 1,\n      \"why\": \"重新感到的温柔正是另一组那份欢喜的来处，也因此让它变得沉重。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S13\",\n      \"chunk\": \"S13-0-0\",\n      \"also\": 1,\n      \"why\": \"停下来就怕失去，正是另一组担心对方不再需要自己的核心不安。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S13\",\n      \"chunk\": \"S13-1-0\",\n      \"also\": 0,\n      \"why\": \"幸福里混入悲伤，对应另一组想要永远的保证却明知无法保证。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S13\",\n      \"chunk\": \"S13-1-1\",\n      \"also\": 0,\n      \"why\": \"握住之后更怕失去，正呼应另一组明知没人能答应永远却仍想要保证。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S14\",\n      \"chunk\": \"S14-1-0\",\n      \"also\": 2,\n      \"why\": \"不再强求保证后的温热与平静，也和另一组决定不再藏起喜欢、以后再说相通。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S14\",\n      \"chunk\": \"S14-2-0\",\n      \"also\": 0,\n      \"why\": \"终于说完开头没说完的话，正回应另一组回望起初不敢多露喜欢的自己。\"\n    }\n  ]\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "8f53ac5b-e91c-42de-8f31-7af616ab88f8", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261105T110213579330Z", "elapsed_seconds": 212.421, "completed_utc": "2026-11-05T11:05:46.016346+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "cf6dd04545c4df6b111694ba5508d3765a473b1ef878af44b1ed613bf390d84d", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "ki